1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,344
Teen trigonometry identities —
yaad sirf ek karni hai!

2
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:08,106
Sine square theta plus cos square theta
equals one.

3
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:11,148
Isse cos square theta se divide karo…

4
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:15,135
tan square theta plus one
equals sec square theta.

5
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:17,885
Aur sine square theta se divide karo…

6
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:21,642
one plus cot square theta
equals cosec square theta.

7
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:26,645
sec square minus tan square
one hota hai — ulta nahi.

